      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The Authors illustrate a case of torsion of the Fallopian tube in a young girl not yet sexually active. Even though this pathology is very rare in childhood and early puberty, torsion of the fallopian tube should be considered as a possible differential diagnosis in intermittent abdominal pain."},
